{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國閃存晶片製造商長江存儲（YMTC）正在將技術佈局從NAND閃存擴展至DRAM內存領域。據Counterpoint Research近期披露的信息，長江存儲正在開發數據傳輸速率達到9600 MT/s的低功耗內存產品，並計劃在武漢第三座晶圓廠推進量產。這意味着，長江存儲正嘗試進入由三星、SK海力士、美光等企業長期主導的DRAM市場。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583554.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:23:48.986500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:57:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.769406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.769406+00:00","content_hash":"634969fea6390d4770a66acb18780ca369c8b37ac1c45a8132ea765b039a1986","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}